  "description": {
    "text": "The 2023 Pokémon World Championships, held from 11 to 13 August 2023 at Pacifico Yokohama, the first in Japan. Competitors got the first Paradise Resort, Naoki Saito's art hiding the traditional Psyduck upside down among Yokohama's landmarks; staff got a Staff copy, and top finishers copies stamped with their placing.\n\nThe top four of each age division received No. 1 to No. 4 Trainer trophy cards, with new pictures by 5ban Graphics of Pikachu lifting a gold cup in a burst of confetti and streamers.",
    "sources": [
      {
        "title": "Pokumon: No.1 Trainer (World Championships 2023)",
